C03: a genre quoted from a search snippet is not metadiscourse (KNOWLEDGE1475)

KNOWLEDGE1473 measured that «Que es doom eternal=» found the pages and the three faithful drafts repeated the Spanish Wikipedia snippet («videojuego de acción de disparos en primera persona desarrollado por id Software y publicado por Bethesda Softworks…»), but the composer's `_TASK_METADISCOURSE` veto rejected «en primera persona» as the model describing how it wrote, so nothing was published. The pattern now excludes «disparos/juego/vista/cámara/perspectiva/shooter (en) primera persona» and «first person shooter/view/perspective/camera/combat»; «respondo en primera persona» and «I answer in first person» stay vetoed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


